## Visual design (svg-ui-bridge)

- Design format: <SVG | HTML/CSS>. For HTML, follow `references/html-design.md` instead of the
  SVG-only commands below. Record source, screen id/state, viewport and actual screen dimensions;
  run `html_review.py` at each target viewport, inspect PNGs, and name the project's implementation
  screenshot comparison tool (or explicitly record that automated pixel verification is unavailable).

- Design specs: `design/<screen>.svg` (+ generated `<screen>.components.md/.json`). Screenshots: `shots/`.
- Target stack: <React 19 + Tailwind | Rust egui 0.3x | Bevy 0.1x UI | Qt 6 QML | …>
- Canvas sizes: desktop `<1280x800>`, mobile `<390x844>` — one SVG per breakpoint that changes layout.
- Tokens live in `<src/styles/tokens.css | src/theme.rs | …>`, generated from the SVG `<style>` tokens.
  Code never uses literal colours/spacing that exist as tokens.
- Acceptance: `visual_diff.py` overall ≤ <2>% and no component > <10>% (defaults; `--tol 24 --shift 1`). Web: `SVG_UI_RENDERER=playwright`.
- Screenshot command: <`/verify` (pstack project verify skill) | `npx playwright screenshot --viewport-size=1280,800 http://localhost:5173/settings shots/settings.png` | `cargo run --example screenshot -- settings`>

### Mapping overrides (SVG → code)
| SVG | this project |
|---|---|
| `data-component="Button"` | <`components/ui/Button.tsx` variant prop / `widgets::button()`> |
| `data-layout="row …"` | <Tailwind `flex gap-*` / `ui.horizontal`> |
| `data-state` | <`variant`/`state` prop / enum `ButtonState`> |
| icons | <lucide-react / `assets/icons/*.svg`> |

### With superpowers
- In brainstorming, UI work is at least *bounded*; every screen's design section is an approved SVG render.
- Spec (`docs/superpowers/specs/…`) must contain a "Visual design" section linking the SVGs, manifests and the acceptance threshold above.
- writing-plans: one task per manifest component (leaves first) + one assembly task per screen; each task's
  acceptance is the visual_diff command for that screen with `--manifest`.
- verification-before-completion: visual claims need fresh visual_diff PASS output + diff image path.

### Housekeeping
- Commit `design/*.svg` and `design/*.components.*`; ignore generated images:
  `.gitignore` → `design/*.png`, `design/_preview.html`, `shots/*.diff.*`
